    dct:description "Open 2D and 3D morphometrics and coordinates for tens of thousands of Recent planktonic tests" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.165514> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-01--grok--dataset-3> a delphi:EvidenceItem ;
